<!-- ════════════════ 01 · WHY THIS MATTERS ════════════════ -->
  <section data-label="Why" class="slide light cat-themed" style="--c: #d97706;">
    <div class="glow soft"></div>
    <div class="frame">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">01</span>Why this matters</p>
      <h2 class="h2">Tokens are money, time and <span class="accent">quality</span>.</h2>

      <div class="frame-body">
      <div class="problist">
        <div class="prob-row">
          <span class="prob-ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div class="prob-title">Every token costs</div>
          <div class="prob-conseq"><span class="arr">&rarr;</span>You pay per token, and output is three to six times more expensive than input. Waste adds up fast across thousands of requests.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="prob-row">
          <span class="prob-ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12s3-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3 7-10 7-10-7-10-7z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div class="prob-title">More context is not better</div>
          <div class="prob-conseq"><span class="arr">&rarr;</span>Models lose focus as the context grows. Sending too much lowers the quality of the answer.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="prob-row">
          <span class="prob-ic">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div class="prob-title">Slower and more expensive</div>
          <div class="prob-conseq"><span class="arr">&rarr;</span>Unnecessary context wastes tokens and slows down both the agent and your review of the result.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        Token efficiency is not a trade-off. The same approach lowers your costs <strong>and improves your output at the same time</strong>.
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% set slideNumber = "01" %}
    {% set slideTotal = "51" %}
    {% include "../../shared/chrome.njk" %}
  </section>
